A. The Agency shall create and distribute a
poster giving notice of the rights afforded by this
Chapter 14.16. The Agency shall create and distribute the poster in English, Spanish, and anyother languages that are necessary for employersto comply with subsection 14.16.045.B. The poster
shall give notice of:
1. The right to paid sick and paid safe
time guaranteed by this Chapter 14.16;2. The amount of paid sick and paid safe
